                                "sense_id": "e982202c-c326-36c7-92b7-a5cb44fffe8f",
                                "text": "Il n'y a pas de danger qu'on le renvoie, lui le preu des tourneurs de la capitale.",
                                "translation": "There's no danger that he will be sent back, he being the first of the tourneurs of the capital.",
